[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天加藤家是前所未有地热闹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"岛上的孩子们都来玩了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未居然带朋友来家里玩，还真是少见啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这是好事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在远处悄悄观察着孩子们的情况。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15562"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那个……不行哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“嗯……但是……嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的女孩C","text":"“那个是……的呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孩子们围成了一圈，在窃窃私语着什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知道在聊些什么，气氛似乎有点严肃，让人在意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，应该就是些小孩子的话题吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大人还掺和进去就是不解风情了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还是避一下吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了不打扰他们，我决定自己出门走走。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我来到小卖铺，发现那些老面孔们都在场。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他们围坐成一圈在聊着什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这边似乎在进行着大人们的秘密会议。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们凑在一起聊什么呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“哦，是鹰原啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“来得正好呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么叫来得正好？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也加入了他们四个。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我们正在开黑历史会议呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“黑历史？……听起来不太妙啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这不是每个人的必经之路吗？中学二年级左右的时候。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是那种黑历史啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说到这里就能理解的话……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10282"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“果然，你也有过那么一段时期呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可我早就毕业了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那我们当然也都毕业了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10276"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“但是，一聊起来又会兴奋得停不下来不是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我很懂这种心情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我还留着那本‘笔记’呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10218"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎؟!你还留着啊؟!我早就烧掉了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“烧掉了吗？还真是彻底啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10252"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“因为那种东西……绝对不能让别人看到啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“确实……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是被谁看到的话就真的只能切腹了。里面写的内容就是令人羞耻到了这个程度。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我倒是没有记在笔记里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“彻底的妄想派啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯～黑历史还真是不得了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“干嘛啊，说得好像你就没有似的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我可没有这种经历哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？良一没有发病吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10284"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“很意外吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那时候，我已经只对裸体感兴趣了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是另一种意义上的发病。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“唔，这么一说的话，我也没有类似的记忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"一同","text":"“你这叫现在进行时。”“你是现在进行时好吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“干嘛一副不服气的表情啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10290"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你不是还把乒乓球的动作命名为招式吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……？乒乓球就是这样的运动啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此，这就是所谓的天性啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“野美希你也是，会给水枪起名字就已经是现在进行时了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……？水枪就是这样的东西啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这边的天性也很纯粹呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11734"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“什么……你说我和天善一样……吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇，她是真的受打击了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“啊，不过我倒是会背这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12186"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“临·兵·斗·者·皆·阵·列·在·前！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一以气势汹汹地一通结印。从那娴熟的手法可以看出他以前没少练习。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“九字护身法啊。这个大家都会背着玩呢。”"},{"op":"goto","target":281},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还有恶魔的名字和天使的等级什么的，我也能背。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“还会攒一些酷炫过头的汉字。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说到这里，我感到每个人发病的方式还真是各具特色。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“之前野美希有段时间不是对能量水晶很着迷吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11886"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那、那只是个类似护身符的东西！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你也不用觉得害羞。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我甚至还自创过咒语呢。一旦开始想咒语就停不下来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“呃……那就有点……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？你们就没有想过吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“完全无法理解。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是吗？苍你应该懂的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“…………哼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她移开了视线！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“鹰原，我觉得这真的很羞耻。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“打个乒乓球还要喊奥义的人可没资格说我吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"开诚布公过头了，又弄得自己很丢脸。"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“说起来，龟龟气功波我也疯狂练习过呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，那个果然大家都会玩啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过这个年纪再玩就不太好了。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":151,"value":["==",["v",413],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，不过前几天我还看到白羽在玩哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10224"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？白羽？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“她一个人？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，虽然不是龟龟气功波，是灵弹……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这时，背后传来一阵杀气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊！白、白羽……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13188"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我才没有！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽大喊了一声就飞奔而去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……明明就有。”"},{"op":"goto","target":154},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说到底，女生应该不会做这种事的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说起来，前几天羽未也玩了哦？”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":160,"value":["==",["v",413],1]},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"goto","target":167},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？羽未？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且还是魔王怨杀光龙波。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":172,"value":["==",["v",413],1]},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"goto","target":173},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哦，不错啊！选这招的品味，感觉很有前途嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，她练得可认真了。一点多余的动作都没――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这时，背后又传来一阵杀气。"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15824"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽、羽未？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未涨红着脸瞪着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的脸红得都快哭出来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15826"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“为……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15829"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“为什么要说出来啊――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽、羽未!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15826"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“明明说好要保密的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……糟了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊～对不起！不过在场的大家都不会笑话你的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“倒不如说是感同身受……毕竟大家都是腿上中过箭的人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10120"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“别说什么中箭啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以说，羽未……”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15829"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“鹰原哥是大笨蛋――――――!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i15936"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完这句话，羽未就哭着跑开了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“唉～把她弄哭了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可我也没有那个意思……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过，听你们刚才说的，这应该是约好了不能告诉别人的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“也就是说你违背了约定。那就是鹰原的错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……确实没什么好辩解的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说是我一个大嘴巴说出来的，但违反约定伤到了羽未是不争的事实。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我该怎么办？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“只能老老实实道歉了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“带上这个，回去跟她道歉吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍给我递过来一袋零食大礼包。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“五百万日元哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还要收钱啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，赔礼的时候带点吃的倒也常见。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"希望这样她能原谅我……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我回来了――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到家时，屋子里空荡荡的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未好像还没回来的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没办法，这个就先放在这里吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把零食大礼包放在起居室的桌子上，回到了自己的房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"先小睡一会，等羽未回家吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i73"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我醒了过来。窗外不知不觉已经天黑了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“糟了，睡过头了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未回来了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i63"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去客厅一看，发现镜子阿姨在那里。她好像在一个人吃饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但没有看到羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个，羽未呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽未的话，她说有事要做，做完饭就马上回房间没出来了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“饭……是指这个吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨正在吃着貌似很美味的炒饭。但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的盘子里却是……堆成了小山的白米饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就我是白米饭吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“她说给羽依里的是强调食材本味的简约炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是，炒饭的定义到底是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，好歹还是煮熟的米饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是给我一盘强调食材本味的生米，那就太吓人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过看这样子，羽未是真的很不高兴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再这样下去，我可能今年整个夏天都要吃强调食材本味的饭菜了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“得想想办法才行……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之，明天一定要跟她好好道歉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我可是能低头认错的成年人。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“还会去背密教真言什么的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，会的会的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗡阿毗罗吽欠娑婆诃！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15010"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哼，大日如来啊。很经典呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10272"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10249"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗡！吉里迦！娑婆诃！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你这是什么来着？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10685"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“砰♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊！稻荷!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10686"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“砰砰砰～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么回事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说，你刚才跑哪里去了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10679"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“砰？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是只神出鬼没的狐狸。"},{"op":"goto","target":106},{"op":"end"}]